window.products.push({"id":435037,"name":"Giantex Adjustable Bed Base with Remote, Zero Gravity Electric Adjustable Bed w/ Head and Foot Incline, Vibration Massage, USB Ports, Under-Bed Nightl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":599.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eavaqSRSS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Powerful & Comfortable Massage】: The adjustable bed frame features vibrating nodes at both the bed head and foot for powerful massage function. There are four massage modes to satisfy your different demands like continuous working. Besides, it is remote control for easy operation. 【Independent Head & Foot Adjustment】: The back can be flexibly adjusted from 0 degrees to 70 degrees while the legs are adjustable in 0-44 degrees. In addition, the head and foot incline can be lifted or lowered individually, adding a great convenience of usage. You can choose the most comfortable angle as you need. 【Quiet & Pleasant Sleeping Experience】: There are pre-set positions for your reference, like zero gravity position, memory position, TV position, anti-snore position, etc. If you don't like these angles, you only need to press the flat button and it will return to the factory settings. Besides, it works without any thumping sound for restful sleep. 【USB Ports, Flashlight & Mattress Retainer】: USB ports at the side of the bed and under bed nightlight for lighting. The bed frame comes with retainer bar that is designed to hold the mattress in place for better articulation. It is suitable to various kinds of mattress, such as memory foam, gel foam and so on. 【Simple Assembly & Strong Load Capacity】: This bed frame is easy to install under the guidance of instruction. Just open your adjustable bed base, then fix on the legs which are adjustable in 3 heights, 4\", 7\" and 11. Insert the mattress retainer bar and plug it in. The bed frame can bear a maximum weight of 850 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eavaqSRSS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Giantex","source_asin":"B096SMHXN9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-435037","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096SMHXN9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096SMHXN9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
