window.products.push({"id":435081,"name":"ORIGINAL Neware EUROCOOK JADE Powder-coated Non-Stick Ceramic Cookware Set, 4-Piece PFOA-Free Kit: Frying Pans and Casserole with Tempered Glass Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jZV-atCTS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Safer and healthier home cooked meals are one click away! The Neware Jade Eurocook 4-piece set includes two (2) frying pans and one (1) stock pot with tempered glass lid, ideal for casseroles. Each aluminum pan/pot is sealed with a ceramic and jade powder coating finish to provide a highly reinforced surface that delivers uniform heat conduction with maximum resistance, resulting in faster and healthier meal preparations. Made with unique impact technology, forming an ultra-durable rock like finish, the Eurocook series features Neware's three layer nonstick surface for maximum resistance and outstanding food release. The triple coating does not accumulate residues like dirt, grease or food particles, making cleaning very easy, even standing up to abrasives and over-aggressive scrubbers. Peace of mind is delivered with the non-toxic surface, free from PFOA and PFOS, so you can feel good feeding only the ingredients you choose in your meals. This versatile Jade cookware set is compatible with all types of cooktops: electric, gas and induction. The high-heat resistance (up to 550F!) gives you the flexibility to cook, bake and enjoy your favorite recipes, or even try some of the newest cooking trends from social media. Whether you are new to cooking or simply looking to add to your kitchenware, the Neware Jade Eurocook set has you covered.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jZV-atCTS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Neware","source_asin":"B08W2P2V3K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-435081","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08W2P2V3K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08W2P2V3K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
