window.products.push({"id":435167,"name":"Violet Linen Deluxe Checkered Gingham Pattern, Vinyl Tablecloth Elestic, Polyester Flannel Backed Lining, Blue, 28 x 72 Inch, 3-Piece Set, Picnic Tabl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/910PddqjehL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Violet Linen Inc. was founded in 1996 and established in the beginning of 1997. Violet Linen's mission is to preserve the look and touch of many generations back \"Grandma's magnificent tablecloth,\" while focusing at the same time on easy care, durability and at very aggressive pricing, and they are proud to have accomplished their goals and objectives well beyond their expectations and have ever since enjoyed a sterling reputation among their thousands of customers. Its notable benefits include: A must have for any gathering Whatever your dinner plans are, whether a camping trip, or just a simple family picnic at home, make sure to take this picnic table cover with you! It's a must have for your camping, BBQ, or party. Tired of the cleaning? Trying to save the after party cleanup, or minimize the mess? You've just found the perfect solution, this table cover will help reduce your cleanup time. The vinyl tablecloth easily wipes clean, eliminating scrubbing off sticky party leftover stains and spills Make any spot; the perfect spot Are the picnic table at your park or camping site dirty and unhygienic? This is what you've been missing. Save yourself the frustration of trying to find the perfectly clean and ideal place to eat dinner at the park. Instantly turn any gross, unhygienic and dirty table into a sanitary, clean and fresh tablescape; ready to serve up dinner. Save yourself and family or friends, the unpleasantness of a messy situation, rather enjoy your time together Secure fit, Elastic bands in the corners offer a smooth, flawless fit and ensures that your tablecloth will stay securely held in place. Wind or rain, you can rest assured that your tablecloth and bench covers will still be there when you return. Enjoy frustration-free dining. Whether dealing with active kids or a large crowd, this vinyl picnic table and bench covers will not slide around easily, preventing spills and a mess from happening.Keep your tablecloth tight, smooth, and stationary Checkered design, Gingham check tablecloth is the ultimate in classic design, lending a casual style to any table. Loved for decades and used at parties, picnics, cozy cafés, and everyday meals at kitchen tables. Perfect for all types of indoor and outdoor dining. From the ranch to the park, whether it's for casual gatherings, backyard picnics, or lunch on your patio this is the quintessential visual appetizer to any country meal. Be prepared to receive many compliments Easy to clean, Easy to clean, either by wiping or spot cleaning with a damp cloth. Always wipe up spills promptly. Use a soft cloth or sponge with a mixture of dishwashing liquid and water. Always \"rinse\" with a clean, damp white cloth. Do not use chlorine bleach which may cause it to crack or harsh, abrasive cleaners which will scratch the surface. With a bit of care, the table covers can last for many years. Liquid-proof. The vinyl top won't allow drinks and other liquids to stain the tablecloth. You'll love how it protects your tables from liquid spills and food stains from messy eaters, making it the perfect pick for a picnic table. Why choose style or function, have them both. Flannel backed vinyl table and bench covers offer great protection for your table surface from scratches, wear and damage. Whether marble or wood, always protect your table in style. Classic design and great functionality, it's what we do. Painting, coloring, gluing and making a mess can be fun! The large HomeCrate table cover, is ideal for protecting table tops in messy play activities. Allow your kids to explore and enjoy their creativity, while you enjoy the time in a fun, relaxed, stress-free atmosphere. Take out your paints, markers or crayons and have a blast drawing and splashing on the table cover. When your kids are using paints, markers, glues and other sticky and messy substances, it shouldn't leave a mess. Just slip on the HomeCrate table cover on your table and let your kids enjoy their messy little hands. Its vinyl surface prevents seepage of liquids or paints and is easy to wipe clean. It will not stick to your artwork like newspaper or transfer print. You'll be glad you did, once you see what the tablecloth looks like, while your table is squeaky-clean, as if it never happened! That's the magic to a mess-free; stress-free playtime!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/910PddqjehL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Violet Linen","source_asin":"B086NR7SP5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-435167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086NR7SP5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086NR7SP5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
