window.products.push({"id":435265,"name":"Arc 42 Stainless-Steel 8-Piece Cookware Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Rz3lnNHPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Arc 42 Stainless 8 Piece Cookware Set tried and tested by Gary Rhodes Amazon.com Isn't it about time cookware showed some revolutionary changes? Chef's Planet combines the best of innovation, ergonomics, and beauty with Arc 42 cookware. The radical change is the handle: instead of typical long handles that strain the wrist, Arc 42's handles feature cool-touch, soft silicone grips and are angled in a unique way that leverage forearm muscles (in a comfortable 42-degree arc from the body). As a result, you simply and easily pour away from you, just like using a kettle. Each pot or pan has a pouring lip, and each lid features a wide band with different sized holes, so you can regulate steam release during cooking and strain the water after cooking without needing a colander. The eight pieces in this set will convert you in no time, as they did British celebrity chef Gary Rhodes. Included are a 9-1/2-inch frying pan with Teflon Platinum nonstick finish; 2- and 4-quart saucepans, each with a single angled handle and a glass lid; and a 6-quart casserole/stockpot with two silicone side handles, a 9-1/2-inch steamer insert, and a glass lid. Each piece is constructed of durable 18/10 stainless steel in a handsome brushed finish with a polished band around the top for contrast. Aluminum encapsulated in the base ensures even heat distribution during cooking. The handles and lids are perfectly safe for oven-heating and use on any type of stovetop burner. A superb gift set for yourself or someone special, the cookware is dishwasher-safe and covered by a lifetime warranty against defects, except for the nonstick finish in the frying pan. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box Arc 42 cookware set. The set consists of: 9-1/2-inch nonstick frying pan; 2-quart casserole with lid; 4-quart casserole with lid; 6-quart casserole with lid; 9-inch steamer basket. 8 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Rz3lnNHPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Arc 42","source_asin":"B0013AA7I6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-435265","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0013AA7I6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0013AA7I6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
