window.products.push({"id":435279,"name":"VAHDAM, Glenburn Classic Darjeeling First Flush Black Tea 2020 | 3.53Oz, 100g | Pure 100% Unblended Darjeeling Black Tea | Premium Loose-Leaf Tea | Si","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MAi45BFaL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"CLASSIC NEW ARRIVAL 2020: Glenburn Classic Darjeeling First Flush Black Tea is a Spring chinary tea from Darjeeling’s Glenburn estate with delectable brisk citrus green flavors. Indulge in a pure, fresh flavours sourced from the choicest single estates. A forever favorite of any tea connoisseur. HISTORICAL SIGNIFICANCE OF GLENBURN: Glenburn is one of the first tea estates to have come up in 1859 in Darjeeling. Owned and lovingly nurtured by the Prakash family, it is now the fourth generation of the family who is managing it. Now famous as the Chaiwala family for their century-old association with the estate. CARBON & PLASTIC NEUTRAL BRAND - Established in India by a 28-year-old 4th generation entrepreneur, we are now proud to be a certified Carbon-Neutral & a Plastic-Neutral brand. We measure our overall carbon and plastic footprint & offset it via our investments in environment sustainability initiatives in India. A BRAND WITH A BILLION DREAMS - Established in India by a 26-year-old, 4th generation Tea entrepreneur, Vahdam Teas is an award-winning, vertically integrated tea brand that door delivers the world's freshest tea leaves to over 83 countries, sourced directly from India's choicest tea gardens. The tea industry is one of the largest employers of manual labor in India. A successful home-grown brand helps empower millions of these tea workers in the long run. ETHICAL, DIRECT & FAIR-TRADE- TRULY - Our innovative supply chain model ensures you get the freshest cup of tea and our farmers get a better price for their produce. 1% of our revenue is redirected towards the education of our tea growers' children. Our farmers, like any other parent, wish for their progeny to have a better life than them. We at Vahdam Teas with our social initiative, TEAch Me, simply wish to honor this aspiration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MAi45BFaL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VAHDAM","source_asin":"B07Y5PVJ76","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-435279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y5PVJ76","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y5PVJ76","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
