window.products.push({"id":435529,"name":"BeldiNest Handcrafted Olive Wood Rustic Cutting Board with Handle, Wooden Board (16+)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ApH0QVYiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This olive wood cutting board is the perfect addition to your kitchen. Handcrafted out of sturdy and durable olive wood, this cutting board is sure to last you through countless recipes. The unique shape of the wooden cutting board makes for an elegant design and features a handle for convenient carrying. The cutting board also has a juice catcher, which is handy for cutting meats and juicy fruits and vegetables. The juice catcher grooves collect all the liquids leaving your countertop clean as can be. This olive wood cutting board has many different uses. Its perfect for cutting meats for a variety of reasons. In a world where people are beginning to season their cutting boards for steaks and other meats, the olive wood cutting board would a perfect chopping block to do that for. The juice catcher catches and blood, oil, or grease from the meats, and works well with juicy fruits and vegetables like tomatoes leaving your kitchen counter clean as can be. You can cut anything you need for your favorite recipes on this BeldiNest olive wood cutting board.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ApH0QVYiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BeldiNest","source_asin":"B082348R86","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-435529","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082348R86","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082348R86","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":435530,"name":"Arctic Zone Jumbo Hot/Cold Insulated Food Carrier, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1K1XZCkh1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Skip the plastic bags and go Green with the Arctic Zone food Pro Jumbo thermal tote. The tote has a 26.4 gallon Capacity so it can easily accommodate a shopping trip's worth of frozen food and perishables. And, not only does this insulated tote keep food cold or frozen, but it can also keep food hot! SuperFoam insulation plus Therma-Flect Radiant barrier combine to provide superior cold or heat retention so you don't have to worry if you're traveling long distances or making a few more stops after picking up groceries. The tote also features an Ultra safe easy clean lining with Microban that helps to inhibit the growth of bacteria that can cause odors and stains. The handles can be used to carry the tote vertically (groceries! picnics! potlucks!) or horizontally (pizza! sheet cakes!). it easily stores in your car trunk so that unexpected grocery stops mean you're always ready for temperature sensitive items. Some tips for getting the most from your Jumbo thermal tote: the hotter or colder the contents are when placed inside the tote, the longer cold or heat will be retained. The fuller your tote is with food, the longer the contents will stay cold or hot. Place ice, ice packs, ice substitutes or hot packs on the top and bottom of the tote for best cooling or heating results. Easy to clean: both the interior and exterior of this Product can be easily wiped clean with a damp cloth with mild dishwashing liquid soap. Practice food safety: when transporting food, it is extremely important to keep cold food cold and hot food hot so that your food never reaches the \"temperature Danger zone\". this is where bacteria can grow quickly and cause food related illness. Keep cold food at or below 40 DegreeF and hot food at 140 DegreeF or above. An appliance thermometer is an easy way to make sure your foods are at the right temperature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1K1XZCkh1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Arctic Zone","source_asin":"B0784WZR3N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-435530","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0784WZR3N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0784WZR3N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":435531,"name":"Cheerland Glitter Champagne Gold Garland Party Decorations Hanging Circle Dot Banner Streamer Backdrop Decor Wedding Birthday Bday Engagement Bridal B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61crykI-i6L._AC_SL1003_.jpg","description":"👍Package Include: 4 strings of 13 ft. champagne gold garland, totally 52 ft. 2 strings are shiny reflective metallic and 2 strings are glittering. Each paper circle is approx. 2 inches in diameter. 👍Unique Design: These strings of circle streamer impress and delight people with a warm, luxurious and cheerful atmosphere and to bring about joy and good fortune to everyone joining. They are the must-buy decorations for parties and home decor. 👍Brilliant Decor for Most Occasions: These shining and glitter garlands fit as bunting and banner most celebrations and parties such as wedding, engagement, bachelorette, bridal shower, baby shower, christening, birthday, sweet 16, retirement, Christmas, New Year... They are also brilliant seasonal/festive ornaments to the regular home furnishings. 👍Easy to Use: NO DIY needed. Unravel the strings with care to avoid tangling. Just hang them or stick them on wall, window, furniture, from ceiling, verandah or as background, backdrop of photo booth. Environmental friendly, reusable if taken down. 👍Quality Guarantee: High quality card paper, not easy to bend, sturdy string and long-lasting color and coating.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61crykI-i6L._AC_SL1003_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cheerland","source_asin":"B09L79D1C1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-435531","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L79D1C1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L79D1C1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
