window.products.push({"id":435598,"name":"Foaming Soap Dispenser, Elbwenly 12oz/350ml Touchless Automatic Soap Dispenser, Battery Operated Hands-Free Soap Dispenser for Kitchen, Bathroom-White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511ynHyFB3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"0.2S Fast Foaming: Elbwenly automatic soap dispenser uses the latest accurate infrared motion and PIR sensor detection technology. Put your hands at a distance of 2~5cm from the spout, and the foaming soap dispenser can quickly react to foam in 0.2 seconds, bringing you touchless security and deep cleaning. The automatic soap dispenser is perfect for your bathroom, kitchen, coffee bar, or hotel. Easy Use of One Button: Equipped with an intelligent sensor and led indicator, the soap dispenser is very easy to operate. Touch the top button, the white light for turn on, and the yellow light for turn off. It is super easy for you to get dense and thick soap foam in seconds. 12oz/350ml Large Capacity: The smart soap dispenser with 350ml/12 oz high capacity can wash our hands more than hundreds of times on a single fill. In high-use bathrooms and kitchens, we significantly reduced the number of regular soap refills! Energy-Efficient Motor： Adopting the energy-efficient and ultra-quiet foaming motor made in Taiwan， with a speed of 7000 rpm, creates fine and rich foam, providing a more comfortable experience. 4 AAA batteries can provide up to 6 months of battery life. Suitable for Various Soaps or Liquids: The automatic hand sanitizer dispenser can work with hand sanitizer, shampoo, dish soap, or other liquid soaps. Regular soap-based detergents (thick detergents, such as dishwashing detergent, etc.): Please pour 1.5 oz (45 ml) of regular soap (Measuring Cup Included) into the automatic soap dispenser and fill it with water. Stir well (VERY IMPORTANT), and you will have the perfect lather.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511ynHyFB3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elbwenly","source_asin":"B0B7K9GJL9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-435598","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7K9GJL9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7K9GJL9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
