window.products.push({"id":435602,"name":"Whiskey glasses Set of 6 - Sake Sets, Clear Shot Glasses Bar Set, Old Fashioned Drinking Glasses Gift Set, Brandy Snifter Whisky Glass for Scotch Bour","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+r8SL45zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE AUTHENTIC WHISKEY GLASS: In all time of whiskeys history it never had a glass that whisky can call its pride. Now, the Lamarada Glass has finally emerged. The Lamarada Glass' origin lies in the traditional nosing and tasting glassware used by professional blenders and connoisseurs around the world. ENHANCE YOUR WHISKEY EXPERIENCE: This unique and stylish shape has been crafted with eminent care and embodies unrivaled sophistication to enhance the enjoyment of single malts and aged blends. The flaring mouth takes the experience to another level and allows ease of drinking while capturing all of the essential aromas. The bulbous cup allows for the fullest appreciation of the whiskey's brilliant color and its solid double base was invented to be easy to hold without contact with the whiskey. EXUDE CONFIDENCE: Nothing beats the feel of drinking whiskey when they are from high end quality old fashioned unique whiskey tasting glasses. Rest assured this glass cup set is here to impress and give that experience you can only imagine. See it for your own eyes and witness it all in person. PERFECT WHISKEY GIFT SET: Each Whiskey Glass tumbler is carefully packaged in a unique elegant gift box. An exceptional value and an excellent gift for any occasion, perfect for wedding, birthday, fathers day, christmas and anniversary gifts, it can also be used as a your favorite rocks glasses bar set at home. ADD A WOW FACTOR TO YOUR DINING TABLE AND PARTIES. Wanna be creative? Use these glasses as beautiful desert cups or use them for their true purpose of drinking any liquor like Scotch Whiskey, Bourbon, Old Fashioned Cocktail, or Cognac, or use them as classy juice or water glasses and receive your loved ones compliment you've always dreamed of. FOOD SAFE: Feel safe serving beverages to loved ones in this guaranteed lead-free and BPA free drinkware set. No worries about harmful chemicals and substances leaching into your drinks here! YOUR SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: Our brand values are Quality, Trust and Integrity, Customer satisfaction has always been our top priority, all of our products come with a 100% satisfaction guarantee. We guarantee 30 days money back and free replacement, professional after-sale service with a 24 hours response lead.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+r8SL45zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lamarada","source_asin":"B0BHKY8WVD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-435602","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHKY8WVD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHKY8WVD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":435603,"name":"Enesco Disney Traditions by Jim Shore Pluto and Mickey Mouse Birthday Cake Figurine, 6.2 Inch, Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":70.3,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XXmSAkJRS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Disney Traditions collection by Jim Shore combines the magic of Disney with the time-honored motifs of handcrafted folk art. It's Pluto's birthday! Mickey makes his favorite pal a birthday cake to celebrate, but will it make it to the birthday party? This marvelous mouse will have to keep the plate out of his dog's reach for a few more minutes at least! About Us: Enesco is committed to BRING JOY EVERY DAY. The premier global destination for high-quality giftware, and home décor, our prestigious family of brands includes: Department 56 Village, Things Remembered, Foundations, Jim Shore Heartwood Creek, Disney Traditions by Jim Shore, Disney Showcase Collection, Disney by Britto, Designs by Lolita, Our Name is Mud, and many more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XXmSAkJRS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Enesco","source_asin":"B083SJV9LG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-435603","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083SJV9LG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083SJV9LG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
