window.products.push({"id":435609,"name":"BestWell Direct 17 OZ Vacuum Insulated Water Bottle, Double Walled Stainless Steel Cola Shape, 24hrs Cold, 12hrs Hot, Drink Flask with Silicone Carrie","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pKMCXvSDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Instructions: When in use, please put a spoonful of soda into the cup with warm water from time to time, disinfect the bottle when the cap is opened, and then rinse thoroughly with warm water. 1. Cleaning cups with edible vinegar once a month is very beneficial to health and long-term use. When cleaning, 1-2 drops of edible vinegar can be diluted in warm water, poured into a thermos cup, opened the bottle cap and placed for 30 minutes, then wiped clean with a soft cloth. Vinegar washing is very effective for cleaning fine matter and bacteria.  2. Because of the temperature difference between the insulating cup and the outside air, the middle cap is prone to produce water vapor and condensation, which is a normal phenomenon.  3. The cup itself will not rust, but it may produce rusty red spots due to scale. 10% warm vinegar water can be poured into the cup for 30 minutes, and then wiped with a soft cloth to remove.  4. When using the product, be sure to operate in the upright state of the product. (When there is hot water in it, it may cause scald if water vapor is ejected from the internal pressure)  5. When pouring cold water into the product, adding a few ice cubes will be more effective.  6. Bottle cap and sealing ring are consumables. Water leakage or poor performance may result from wear and tear after long use. When encountering this situation, please purchase the corresponding accessories for replacement. There is an extra lid in the package that can be replaced. A good way to get rid of flavor Newly purchased cups and kettles because of the factory plastic mold opening reasons will have some food-grade PP plastic odor, which is a normal new product odor, the first use can be used in the following ways to remove odor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pKMCXvSDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BestWell Direct","source_asin":"B07VF2435G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-435609","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VF2435G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VF2435G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
