window.products.push({"id":435675,"name":"NEST Fragrances Reed Diffuser- Lemongrass & Ginger , 5.9 fl oz - NEST08-LG","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":58.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GiM1fovtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy exquisite, uninterrupted home fragrance for up to 90 days with the NEST New York Lemongrass & Ginger Reed Diffuser. Expertly crafted in the USA with the highest quality alcohol-free fragrance oils, this reed diffuser is housed in a glass vessel adorned with elegant, frosted stripes that makes a beautiful addition to any room. Vibrant lemongrass and aromatic ginger combine with an herbal infusion of eucalyptus, thyme, and sage in this sophisticated fragrance, creating a fresh and exhilarating mood for your environment. The glass vessel measures 3.75 inches wide, 4.5 inches high, and 2 inches deep. Eight all-natural rattan reed sticks and 5.9 fluid ounces of oil are included. The intensity and reach of the fragrance can be customized based on the number of reed sticks used. As part of an ongoing commitment to cruelty-free practices, NEST New York has been certified by PETA, a leading organization that certifies brands that operate without animal testing. NEST New York’s fragranced home, perfume, and body care collections transform the everyday by artfully blending notes of the familiar, the exotic, and the unexpected for a fragrance experience like no other. Let NEST New York scent your world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GiM1fovtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEST Fragrances","source_asin":"B07Y47249K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-435675","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y47249K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y47249K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":435676,"name":"Ragproper Glass Flask Accessories Extras (Single Shot 100mL)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wHUjp9frL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LIQUOR FLASK ACCESSORY KIT: Complement your liquor glass flasks with our accessory set. It comes with everything to help you maintain your flasks in prime shape and form. LIDS, FUNNELS INCLUDED: The kit comes with 1 stainless steel lid and 1 sneaky plastic lid, allowing you to go utterly metal-free if needed and sneak in the flask wherever you are going. We also provide two smooth pour funnels with air tunnels for easy, seamless pouring. CLEANING BRUSH & LID LINERS: 10 cork lid liners and 5 silicone lid liners are also provided in this liquor flask accessory kit. Lastly, you also get a cleaning brush that you can use to clean the flask from inside thoroughly. EXTEND THE LIFE OF YOUR GLASS FLASK: With this small investment, you can prolong the life of your liquor flasks and protect them from the extremities of outdoor conditions. CUSTOMER SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: If you are not happy with the accessory kit or have any problems, please reach out to us, and we will fix it in a jiffy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wHUjp9frL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ragproper","source_asin":"B08LV2Z1GT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-435676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LV2Z1GT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LV2Z1GT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":435677,"name":"Fuzzy FlagsTM Fleece Jamaican Flag Blanket - 80-inch x 50-inch Oversized Flag of Jamaica Travel Throw Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R4ZqyKhQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made of 100% polar fleece polyester. Matching green stitching around the edges. Machine washable, wrinkle resistant. Accurate design and dimensions. Very soft and warm. Brightly Colored. Covers a full sized mattress, but is wide enough for queen sized beds (as seen in picture.) Looks great in the living room, at sporting events and concerts, while traveling or outdoors. Brand New in Portable Carry Bag. Makes a Great Gift! Wholesale opportunities available.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R4ZqyKhQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fuzzy Flags","source_asin":"B016VKQ1KK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-435677","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016VKQ1KK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016VKQ1KK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":435678,"name":"TIBORANG Nonstick 8 in 1 Multipurpose Woks and Stir Fry Pans,12.6 Inch 6L Heat Indicator Diecast Aluminum Titanium Coating Chinese Wok Pan with Lid, S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a3KcyZYLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍳Exclusive Design Multifunctional Wok Pan: The nonstick wok set is perfect for deep-frying, pressure cooking, steaming, boiling, decocting, grilling, stir frying and Hotpot. You can even use it to steam vegetables. It's a great way to make cooking more fun and inventive. 🍳Save Cooking Time:The pot design 5 layers induction steel plate for rapid even heat distribution from edge to edge, The vertical armed pan cover comes with a 10 KPA micro pressure valve on the fringe, when your dish requires to stew, it will speed up your cooking time as much as 50% compare to ordinary nonstick woks, cast iron pans and stainless steel pans. The flat base makes sure it fits all stoves, including electric stoves, so please don't cook it on a high fire. 🍳Sturdy Wok Body:The hard anodized aluminum is harder than stainless steel and is dense, making it corrosion and scratch resistant, plus it won’t react to acidic foods,Compared with cast iron pans and stainless steel pans, it is light in weight, so Oven safe up to 420°F/216°C, Dishwasher safe. 🍳Non-Stick Coating & Healthy Material:The nonstick frying pan is made of 7 layers of materials. The surface hard titanium coating reinforced, scratch resistant and toxin free nonstick interior stands up to everyday use. and it's very easy to wash. 100% Free of PFAS, PFOA, APEO, lead or cadmium.no need to worry about toxic substances and coatings falling off. 🍳Preheat Function: The front end of the stir fry pan handle has a temperature indicator. The indicator is red before heading, and red changes to white after heating, note that when oil temperature is ≥150℃, it will automatically change to white. Just by observing the color of the indicator, you can know exactly know when the food is ready to be served.Unlike woks & stir-fry pans, the skillet allows you to cook with less oil or butter and the pots and pans is suitable for 3-8 people. 🍳Detachable Bakelite Handle & Easy Storage: The flat wok bottom and handle adopts with invisible screw, which makes it easy to wash and disassemble after each use, no tool is required and no rust over time. Bakelite handles stay cool on the stovetop for maximum comfort. 🍳Vertical Silicone Glass Lid: The lid is surrounded by rubber gasket to preserve heat and prevent lid glass to be shatter. It helps seals in the flavor of the food and preserve nutrients for a healthier and better tasting food. The transparent glass lid helps determine when your food is ready. If you want to clean rubber rip gaskets surrounding the lid, you can sprinkle baking soda and brush it thoroughly, oily smell will go away in no time. 🍳Package & Size: Wok set: 1 x Non stick large wok,1 x Gift Box,1 x wok Lid,1 x wok utensils,1 x 32cm non-stick wok steamer grid,1 x Non-stick silicone pad,2 x Detachable pot ears(Tip:Please note that pot ears must be taken out while cooking, it is only used while serving food to prevent scalding ).1 x Installation instruction,Size: 32 x 21 x 10.5cm/12.6\" x 8.3\" x 4.1\"(Top Dia*Bottom Dia*H). 💡Tips: When you turn off the stove after cooking, please open the lid or press the micro pressure valve button (New Feature) to avoid the excessive pressure in the pot. For safety reasons, after turning off your stove, the maximum duration coving the lid is 30 minutes without releasing the air. 💡 Tip:1:Please do not cook food on a high fire for a long period of time. This will change the color of the pot. All pots do not support long-term dry cooking, so please check the food in the pot in time.2:When you first receive your new induction wok, use warm water to clean it. Avoid using stainless steel scrubbing balls. Then wipe the body of the pot with oil. The best wok coating is more non-sticky.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a3KcyZYLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TIBORANG","source_asin":"B08Y7JR8JT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-435678","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y7JR8JT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y7JR8JT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
