window.products.push({"id":435782,"name":"NILUOH Wingback Chair Slipcover 2-Piece Stretch Wingback Chair Sofa Slipcover Armchair Cover Printed Furniture Protector Couch Soft with Elastic Botto","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VxKq6wjRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Premium Slipcovers for Armchairs】This innovated 2 Piece wingback sofa chair cover is crafted from soft fabric, 92% polyester and 8% spandex, breathable, durable and stretchy, smooth and soft to touch, ensuring both good function and comfort. This wingback armchair chair sofa cover decorated with various patterns. Let your old furniture look new and perfectly match the various home styles you need, and you can save money by extending the service life of the chair and sofa. 【Upgraded 2 Piece Design】Unlike the one-piece wingback chair cover, this cover has an independent cushion cover. Cover your seat cushion alone, not only can the excess fabric be stuffed under the seat cushion, but also the rebound problem is definitely solved. Fits most wing chairs that are 27.6-35.4 inches long, 31.5-39.4 inches high, and 27.6-33.5 inches wide. 【Perfect Chair Protector】The wing chair slipcovers can protect your wing chairs from food and drink spills, pet hair and messy with our wingback sofa cover that are conveniently machine washable,make your furniture stays looking like new. Sofa slipcovers is easy to install and take off, a great partner for household life, especially families with children and pets. 【 Easy to Install】Just locate the tag “BACK” in the middle of the chair back, drape over furniture, tuck the extra fabric and smooth it.Definitely they are your precious private customize home decoration. If you encounter problems during the installation process, please feel free to contact us, we will try our best to ensure that you are 100% satisfied. 【Easy to Care】Machine washable, wash at temperature around 30 degrees Celsius, mild laundey detergents are advised, please do not bleach, do not iron.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VxKq6wjRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NILUOH","source_asin":"B0C24TMN6H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-435782","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C24TMN6H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C24TMN6H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
