window.products.push({"id":435813,"name":"Degrees of Comfort Zoning Weighted Blanket Adults 2 Duvet Covers for Hot & Cold Sleeper Advance Nano-Ceramic Beads Deliver Durability & Silky Comfort ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913BYip9UGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Created by YOU, for YOU Due adult life stress, nervousness can negatively compounded by lack of sleep. This crippling exhaustion can affect loved ones all around resulting in short-temper, decrease work performance and ability to focus. Seeking solution using medication can cause unpleasant side effects. Restlessness in bed can also hamper partner's valuable sleep quality. Something must change. Like most people plagued with sensory issues, this drained existence from sleep deprivation can seem like a life sentence. A discovery of a natural method of nervousness alleviation. The practical, simple secret is weighted blankets. The heaviness stimulates calming chemicals, causing less twitch, feeling secure and allows the mind at ease. Relax Anywhere You Go After seeing life changing results of our larger weighted blankets, we decided to engineer a more versatile, smaller throw blanket design that can easily adapt to your comfort needs in ANY SETTING. Cozy Up and Fall Asleep in the car, on the couch, at night in your bed, outside by the campfire, on the plane ride home literally unwind anywhere! A Gift to Boost Those Brownie Points Many of our beloved customers have given our soft blankets as gifts for patients, anniversaries, bridal and baby showers and birthdays! Any occasion is the proper occasion to bless someone else with the sleep inducing power of weighted blankets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913BYip9UGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Degrees of Comfort","source_asin":"B07S1YN5QL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-435813","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S1YN5QL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S1YN5QL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
