window.products.push({"id":435818,"name":"Bioexcel Alkaline Nano Cup Flask - Choose Color (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ogz0GAaAL._AC_.jpg","description":"As we all know that common water is made of macro molecule group and contains acidity without any mineral elements. If we keep drinking it for long enough then our immune system do not remain strong. This hydrogen water ionizer converts the common water into nanometer activated water while the water goes through Pearl calcium Ion and Energy stone, which can release far infrared and negative ions in molecules and also increase the PH level to make it more soluble and can resist oxidation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ogz0GAaAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bioexcel","source_asin":"B005BRE7VA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-435818","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005BRE7VA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005BRE7VA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":435819,"name":"Simply Baked Small 3 Ounce Disposable Paper Baking Cups, 25 Pack of Cupcake Muffin Wrappers for Baking or Party, Treats, Candy, and Snack Cups, Green ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YxhAsGfvL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"At Simply Baked, we know that providing for your guests is your main priority, and doing it with ease and style is ours. Whether serving up some inspired cupcakes, gifting breads and cakes with our paper baking pans or adding that special message to your creation, you’ll find our unique baking line to be your path to elegant entertaining everyday! We have everything necessary to create the perfect occasion; grand or intimate. Cupcakes have never been so adorable. Breads, cakes and tarts have never traveled in such style, and our cupcake toppers and accessories add that perfect amount of whimsy to your table. Coordinating Designs - Not Just for Baking! Fall in love with our coordinating and stylish and versatile colors, designs, and sizes. Transform your baking cups into gorgeous displays of veggies, snacks, & dips. Our disposable products are oven and freezer safe and pre-greased - no need for cooking spray! We love these little babies with their fabulous colors and even more fabulous function! Choose from a plethora of colors that beautifully complement our large cups and serve as much more than baking cups – Fruit? Chips? Nuts? Candies? Of course! Better than traditional cupcake baking liners - these paper baking cups are sturdy so no muffin tin or cupcake pan necessary! They stand on their own on a flat sheet pan when baking. 25 per sleeve | Holds 3 OZ | 1 5/8\" height | 1 7/8\" base | Pre-greased | Oven & Freezer Safe","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YxhAsGfvL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simply Baked","source_asin":"B00SBEKLTW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-435819","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00SBEKLTW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00SBEKLTW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
