window.products.push({"id":435868,"name":"Swift Home Full/Queen Bedding 100% Cotton Chambray Duvet Cover Set, Yarn Dyed, Prewashed & Pre-Wrinkled – Almond, Full/Queen (90” x 90”) – Comforter N","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Yzm1fz1kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHAT’S INSIDE: Full/Queen Set – One 90”x90” duvet cover and two standard shams 20”x26” with a 2” flange EASY BREEZY: What make a minimalistic room warm and inviting? You can find the answer in the Swift Home 100% Cotton Duvet Cover Set! It is made with a lightly treated all-natural fabric, slightly coarse and wrinkled, and a seamless zipper for a clean design. Equally functional as it is beautiful, it is easy to install and secure inserts with sewn-in corners ties. Also conveniently machine washable, maintenance cannot be any easier! SNOOZE EASY: Achieve cooler sleep with this 100% cotton duvet cover. Great for temperature sensitive sleepers, the natural fabric allows your skin to breathe while also absorbing moisture to help you achieve cooler sleep. Corner ties also help ensure heat dissipates evenly. WELL-LOVED: The duvet cover is made using the same techniques used to make denim fabrics. Dyed yarns are woven with undyed yarns to create its well-loved appearance. The fabric is also sand-washed to pre-shrink and give it its wrinkled texture. Like your favorite pair of jeans, the duvet cover will grow soft with use over time. EASY CARE: Machine wash on gentle cycle with cold water and like colors. Then tumble dry on low and remove promptly. Do not bleach. REST ASSURED: OEKO-TEX certified to be free from harmful chemicals and dyes","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Yzm1fz1kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Swift Home","source_asin":"B0764K2WQJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-435868","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0764K2WQJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0764K2WQJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
