window.products.push({"id":435952,"name":"ABAKAN All Season California King Size Comforter Soft Down Alternative Quilted Duvet Insert Summer Winter Warm Fluffy-Dark Grey-96x104 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Be9Wu6cyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1．MATERIAL AND DIMENSIONS - 100% Polyester fiber Fill, 300 GSM, (Twin size, 64 x 88'' inches. Full size 82 x 86'' inches.Queen size, 88 x 88'' inches. King size, 90 x 102'' inches. California King size, 96 x 104'' inches) 2．EASY CARE & CONVENIENT - Machine wash in a gentle cycle with cold water,Which saves you a lot of time and energy. no clumping or shrinkage. In addition, try to clean it separately, do not wash it with other materials that are easy to fall.Simply sun dry or low tumble dry the comforter.Brand new after washing 3．BOX STYLE STITCHING - Box stitched and well distributed, with no concern for shifting or clumping filling. Exquisite hemming, no need to worry about filling leakage or loose thread ,The four corner tabs make it extremely easy to put on any duvet cover and secures the comforter in place, one corner tab at each side, help you secure the comforter in place 4．SLEEP IN CLOUD- Baffle-box construction maintains comforter evenly distributed for maximum warmth and prevents the down from sneaking out. 8 corner tabs to secure your favorite duvet cover. This lightweight, breathable, noiseless, softness and puffy down duvet insert will help keep you warm and snug 5．NO RISK PURCHASE- We are confident in the quality of product that we offer a 30-day satisfaction guarantee. Please do not hesitate to contact us with any questions or concerns. We want you to be 100% satisfied Tips - To completely fluff up this comforter, we suggest you put it into your dryer or expose it to the sunlight for a few hours. If you need an extra hangover, you should upsize your bedding for that. For example, purchase it in a size king even though your bed is just a queen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Be9Wu6cyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ABAKAN","source_asin":"B08CK8GMRJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-435952","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CK8GMRJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CK8GMRJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
