window.products.push({"id":435965,"name":"Sorbus® Acrylic Cosmetics Makeup and Jewelry Storage Display Case – Great Organizer for Lipsticks, Liners, Brushes, and More–Includes 19 Slots with 3 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R1sCEMF9L._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Tired of rummaging through dresser drawers, purses, and bags trying to find you favorite beauty item? Brush up on your organization skills! The Sorbus Acrylic Cosmetic and Makeup Storage Case arranges all your favorite makeup essentials into one place! This sturdy, clear acrylic makeup organizer includes 3 large drawers and 19 slots to fit various sized cosmetic products. Drawers are perfect for storing lipsticks, foundations, bronzers, blushes, eye shadows, primers, powders, and much more! The stylish and modern acrylic storage case adds refinement to any makeup collection. It brings convenience and functionality by always being able to see your makeup right when you need it. Turn all your loose makeup and cosmetics into your very own beautiful beauty counter. This makeup storage case can be conveniently stored in bathrooms, vanity counters, dressers, and most tabletops. Also a great gift for any makeup lover! A great gift idea for any beauty blogger, makeup artist, or product junkie! This storage case is made of acrylic which is clear/ transparent plastic so you can easily find products. Suitable for home or professional use. Makeup and products are NOT included. Easy to clean. Made of high-quality acrylic which is a clear plastic that resembles glass but stronger and safer. Measures approximately 13\" L x 5.50\" W x 8\" H .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R1sCEMF9L._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sorbus","source_asin":"B06WWPN43H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-435965","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06WWPN43H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06WWPN43H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
