window.products.push({"id":435995,"name":"BREEZEWELL 3-IN-1 Evaporative Air Cooler, Portable Air Conditioner Fan/Humidifier with Ice Box, 12H Timer&Remote Control,Ultra-quiet,65° Oscillating P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":76.4,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FljRhyHbL._AC_.jpg","description":"❄【Fan & Humidification & Cooling 3-IN-1】 If you live in a dry climate and want a cost-effective cooling solution, our evaporative cooler must be worth considering. There are 3 modes for you: wind/humidification/Cooling, It combines the natural cooling properties of water with a steady breeze to lower indoor temperatures. Breezewell stays professional and makes it possible for you to have both cooling and humidifying functions simultaneously at a modest price! ❄【A Real Lifesaver for Energy and Bill 】 An evaporative air cooler will offer several benefits over air conditioner: lower installation and maintenance costs, up to 75% less electricity usage to ease the stress on your bills, no ozone-damaging refrigerants, and adds moisture to relieve dry air symptoms such as itchy eyes, throat, or skin in dry climates. Is there any reason not to try one? Especially when you can’t turn on the central air conditioner, you will definitely understand it! ❄【65° Oscillation & 360° Swivel Wheel】 If you need to spread cool across a wide space, consider a model with oscillating louvers to move air from side to side! This oscillating fan swings horizontally and vertically, up to 65 degrees, which is very suitable for multi-person use. Equipped with 360° rollers and a portable handle, it is also can be easily rolled into different places even in tough conditions like patios, garages, warehouses. Go with Breezewell, heatwave is easy this summer. ❄【Ultra-quiet & Safe Design】 Air cooler should never be annoying goods. The noise of this cooler is as low as 55 decibels, which is considered whisper-quiet. Sweet dreams and peaceful work can be achieved with the help of it. Fan blades can be closed manually to effectively avoid the danger of children’s cute finger inserting, and the machine will automatically beep when the water in the water tank has dried up, all of which are designed to provide a safe and cool environment for you. ❄【Remote Control & 12 HRS Timing】 In order to make your use more convenient, the cooler is equipped with remote control, whether you are on the sofa or on the bed, you can enjoy the cool without moving even a foot. And with a 12-hour timer, you can easily set it to help save energy by turning the unit off automatically. What's more, it has a visible and audible low-water indicator to easily monitor the water level. How wonderful companion for sleeping in the hot summer!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FljRhyHbL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BREEZEWELL","source_asin":"B09MD59GJZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-435995","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MD59GJZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MD59GJZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
